// Rstest Snapshot v1

exports[`the test library's catalogue > background_not_started: the message 1`] = `
"This page has no background thread, which rerender() needs: it was rendered with \`background: false\`.

Render without \`background: false\` to start the background.
https://sohedra.com/e/background_not_started"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > first_frame_copy_missing: the message 1`] = `
"Card has no first-frame copy, so render could not draw its first frame.

Run the test with withSvelteLynx() from @sohedra/lynx/config/rstest without \`firstFrame: false\` in its options, or render without \`lynx: { firstFrame: true }\`.
https://sohedra.com/e/first_frame_copy_missing"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > first_frame_needed_alone: the message 1`] = `
"A page rendered without its background is its first frame alone, so it cannot also leave the first frame out.

Leave out \`firstFrame: false\`, or leave out \`background: false\` to render on the background.
https://sohedra.com/e/first_frame_needed_alone"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > gesture_callback_missing: the message 1`] = `
"The pan gesture on the <view> has no onSwipe callback to run.

Fire a callback the gesture has, or give the gesture that one.
https://sohedra.com/e/gesture_callback_missing"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > gesture_missing: the message 1`] = `
"The <view> has no pan gesture for lynx.gesture to run.

Pass the element whose main-thread:gesture holds the gesture, once the page has set it: await render first.
https://sohedra.com/e/gesture_missing"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > gesture_not_named: the message 1`] = `
"The <view> has several gestures (pan, tap), and lynx.gesture was not told which to run.

Name the kind of gesture to run as the second argument, such as pan or tap.
https://sohedra.com/e/gesture_not_named"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > handler_on_background: the message 1`] = `
"The tap event on a <view> has a handler on the background thread, which this page does not have: the handler did not run.

Render without \`background: false\` to run it.
https://sohedra.com/e/handler_on_background"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > no_page_rendered: the message 1`] = `
"Nothing is rendered, so fireEvent has no page to act on.

Render the component first, and await it.
https://sohedra.com/e/no_page_rendered"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > not_a_list: the message 1`] = `
"A <view> was given to lynx.list, which drives a <list>.

Pass the <list> element itself.
https://sohedra.com/e/not_a_list"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > page_already_rendered: the message 1`] = `
"A page is rendered already, and a Lynx view shows one page at a time.

End the first page with cleanup() or its unmount() before rendering the next.
https://sohedra.com/e/page_already_rendered"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > page_reported_errors: the message 1`] = `
"The page reported 2 errors while the test waited for it.

Each one is in this error's list of errors: fix the first, which may cause the rest.
https://sohedra.com/e/page_reported_errors"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > promise_hooks_missing: the message 1`] = `
"The test page needs Node.js's \`v8.promiseHooks\` to run each thread's promise continuations as that thread, and this runtime has none (node:v8 onInit is not yet implemented in Bun).

Run the tests on Node.js: with Bun, run the test script without \`--bun\`, so the runner starts under Node.js.
https://sohedra.com/e/promise_hooks_missing"
`;

exports[`the test library's catalogue > render_needs_dom: the message 1`] = `
"There is no DOM to put the page's elements in, so render could not draw it.

Run the test with withSvelteLynx() from @sohedra/lynx/config/rstest, which sets up jsdom.
https://sohedra.com/e/render_needs_dom"
`;
